{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1136163-house-of-glass-and-ivory-recruiting-now","id":1136163,"title":"House of Glass and Ivory recruiting now","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-09-01T06:33:31-07:00","id":1136163,"title":"House of Glass and Ivory recruiting now","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">I'm looking for <b>five players</b> for <b>Vampire: the Requiem 2E.</b> You don't need to have prior experience with VtR 2E, but you do need the core rulebook to play the game. This game uses Vampire: the Requiem 2E core rulebook, Secrets of the Covenants, A Thousand Years of Night and World of Darkness: Damnation City as the primary game mechanical sources. Inspiration has been drawn from VtR 1E covenant and bloodline books.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">I'm offering a 10-11 months long chronicle. The game focuses on Western London, set in the year 1860. This is a game of constant conflict and psychological character driven drama. I am offering a rebellion, a revolution and an end to megalomaniacal tyranny. Only to be followed by more of the same under a different name? This is a game about creating lasting change in a society that resists change. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Starting from right now you get to make several choices individually and as a group. Do you want to play a young vampire just learning the ins and outs of Kindred society, or do you want to control an established older vampire with more responsibilities and higher expectations? Was your character Embraced by another PC? If not then who was your Sire? Are you part of London\u2019s old guard or the invading rebels? Will you suffer under the rule of a mad Prince or are you part of the conspiracy to overthrow the Prince? Will you bring the guns, swords and firebombs or try to backstab someone from within?</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Welcome to the last moments of the mad Prince Haddon. What happens after the mad Prince Haddon has met his Final Death? That's where the story really begins. This chronicle is designed as a social game of treachery, greed and influence. Individual aspirations are going to be a major part of the game, but I would suggest that the player characters form a coterie with a strong theme. You should set a common goal and then run with it, while adjusting to the challenges that come up during the game.</span></span><br /> <br /> Please follow this link to <a href=\"https://www.myth-weavers.com/showthread.php?t=412457\" target=\"_blank\">Myth-Weavers</a>, where the game is hosted.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2648,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2648-telperionst","user":"TelperionST","date":". 09-01-2017, 11:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2648-telperionst","name":"TelperionST","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2648_3.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-01T06:40:06-07:00","id":1136165,"title":"","content":"What days and times were you looking at playing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1157-soulgambit","name":"SoulGambit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"912"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-01T06:43:39-07:00","id":1136168,"title":"","content":"Hello TelperionST,<br /> <br /> I would love to participate in your game. I am not familiar with Myth-Weavers though. Is this a play-by-post game? If yes - how often do you need players to post? Also, I can't find a link to the recruitment page on Myth-Weavers... In which thread should I post?<br /> <br /> Edit: found the recruitment page, never mind. Still not sure about the frequency of posting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":14844,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14844-chubby-russian","user":"Chubby Russian","date":". 09-01-2017, 10:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/14844-chubby-russian","name":"Chubby Russian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar14844_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-09-01T07:15:22-07:00","id":1136177,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SoulGambit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1136163-house-of-glass-and-ivory-recruiting-now?p=1136165#post1136165\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What days and times were you looking at playing?</div> </div> </div> </div>This is a play-by-post game with an expected posting frequency of six updates per' week. I usually don't post on Saturdays, but otherwise you'll get a minimum of one major post per' day from me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[]